    "body": "- Change length from `uint16_t` to `uint32_t` in `make_gc_handshake_packet`.\r\n- Add explicit cast to `uint16_t` when calling `wrap_group_handshake_packet`.\r\n\r\nThis is a hardening measure. Currently, `MAX_SENT_GC_NODES` is 1, so the length variable (`uint16_t`) cannot overflow. However, if this constant were increased significantly in the future, the addition `length += nodes_size` could wrap around. This change eliminates that latent risk.\n\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\n- - -\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/2984)\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\n",
    "changed_files": 1,
